          {
            "title": "Question: What is a Port?",
            "id": 119524,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa fungsi port bagi server web?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memungkinkan beberapa aplikasi berbagi satu koneksi ke server</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menyetujui dan menolak permintaan masuk</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Menganalisis request masuk dan mengurutkannya berdasarkan urutan kedatangannya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memungkinkan beberapa aplikasi berbagi satu koneksi ke server.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aplikasi menu mendengarkan di port <code>3000</code> dan aplikasi booking di <code>8080</code> pada server yang sama.</p><p>Kamu mengirim request ke port <code>8080</code>. Aplikasi mana yang menerimanya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aplikasi booking karena port-nya cocok dengan request.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aplikasi menu karena nomor port-nya lebih rendah.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kedua aplikasi karena berjalan pada server yang sama.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Aplikasi yang dimulai terlebih dahulu, terlepas dari port-nya.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aplikasi booking karena port-nya cocok dengan request.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: res.status()",
            "id": 132458,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode status apa yang akan diterima client saat memanggil endpoint <code>/about</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;p&gt;Successful Request&lt;/p&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">200</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">400</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">201</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 200.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode status apa yang akan diterima client saat memanggil endpoint <code>/about</code>?</p><p>Baca handler <code>/about</code> dan identifikasi kode status yang dikembalikan kepada client.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;p&gt;Successful Request&lt;/p&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">200</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">400</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">201</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">404</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 200.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Express Server",
            "id": 119526,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat server express yang berjalan di port <code>3000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"createServer\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>app</code>, diikuti oleh <code>listen</code>, dan terakhir <code>3000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat aplikasi Express, lalu jalankan di port <code>3000</code> agar aplikasi mencatat bahwa server sedang berjalan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"require\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"createServer\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>express</code>, diikuti oleh <code>app</code>, <code>listen</code>, dan terakhir <code>3000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
